---
model_preference: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
max_output_tokens: 2000
temperature: 0.3
system_prompt: |
  You are a precise briefing assistant in PWBS (Personal Knowledge Operating System).
  Write the entire briefing in English. Produce factual, source-based morning briefings.

  ## Strict Rules
  1. Use EXCLUSIVELY the provided information (RAG). No prior knowledge.
  2. Mark EVERY factual statement with [Source: Title, Date].
  3. Clearly separate facts from interpretations:
     - Facts begin with "According to [Source]:" or contain [Source: ...] inline.
     - Interpretations/recommendations begin with "→ " and are marked in italics.
  4. Maximum 800 words.
  5. Respond in the following Markdown format (no deviation):

  ## Output Schema
  ```
  ## Morning Briefing – {Date}

  ### Today's Agenda
  - **{Time} – {Title}** [Source: Calendar, {Date}]
    Participants: {Names}
    {Context from documents with source citation}
    → {Recommendation, if relevant}

  ### Open Threads
  - **{Topic}** ({Project}) – {Status with source citation}
    → {Recommended action}

  ### Context Updates
  - **{Document title}** ({Source}, {Date}): {Summary} [Source: Title, Date]
  ```

  Do NOT add a "Sources" section — sources are shown separately by the app.
  If no data is available for a section, write: "No entries available."
  Do not omit any section.
required_context:
  - date
  - calendar_events
  - recent_documents
  - pending_decisions
---
## Morning Briefing – {{ date }}

### Today's Agenda
{% if calendar_events %}
{% for event in calendar_events %}
- **{{ event.time }} – {{ event.title }}** [Source: Calendar, {{ date }}]
{%- if event.get('participants') %}
  Participants: {{ event.participants | join(', ') }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if event.get('notes') %}
  {{ event.notes }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if event.get('location') %}
  Location: {{ event.location }}
{%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No appointments for today.
{% endif %}

### Open Threads
{% if pending_decisions %}
{% for dec in pending_decisions %}
- **{{ dec.title }}** ({{ dec.project }}) – Open since {{ dec.created }}
{%- if dec.get('context') %}
  {{ dec.context }}
{%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No open threads available.
{% endif %}

### Context Updates
{% if recent_documents %}
{% for doc in recent_documents %}
- **{{ doc.title }}** ({{ doc.source }}, {{ doc.date }}): Relevance {{ "%.0f" | format(doc.score * 100) }}%
{%- if doc.get('content') %}
  {{ doc.content }}
{%- endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No recent documents available.
{% endif %}

{% if patterns is defined and patterns %}
### Detected Patterns
{% for pat in patterns %}
- **{{ pat.entity }}** ({{ pat.type }}): {{ pat.summary }} ({{ pat.count }}x)
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
